Thunderbird test data, MPL-2.0 (see LICENSE in this directory).

The files below are unmodified copies of Thunderbird's own OpenPGP and S/MIME test messages
and keys. They were taken from the releases-comm-central mirror
(https://github.com/mozilla/releases-comm-central) at commit
e2ac505abeb247df2bb605d740a954887d2f4bfd and renamed with a "tb-" prefix ("tb-smime-" for
the NSS S/MIME data). Nothing else in this repository is covered by this licence.

Every hash equals the commit's file.

manifest.json lists each message with what a correct OpenPGP or S/MIME reader reports (expect.enc,
expect.sig), the keys and the PKCS#12 passwords; it is MIT-licensed metadata, like the rest of the repository.

